Package: SocialFacts
Title: Average Attributable Fraction and Other Relevant Social Sciences
        Indicators
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: c(
      person("Alioscha", "Massein", email = "alioscha.massein@cnrs.fr", role = c("aut", "cre", 'cph'), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-5791-1045")),
      person("Brice", "Lefèvre", email = "brice.lefevre@univ-lyon1.fr", role = c("aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2482-7104"))
    )
Description: Compute Average Attributable Fraction (AAF) and produce a GT table with Odds.ratio, Average Marginal Effects and AAF, with confidence interval and p.value. Also compute other metrics such as Yule's Q and Cramer's V. For more details, see Fergusion and al. (2024) <doi:10.1007/s10654-024-01129-1>.
